div.p:
And whereas, in pursuance of Article VIII of the said project of arrangement, the
                    Government of the United States was, on August 18, 1902, invited by the
                    Government of the French Republic to adhere thereto;

And whereas the Senate of the United States, by its Resolution of March 1, 1905
                    (two-thirds of the Senators present concurring therein), did advise and consent
                    to the adhesion by the United States to the said project of arrangement;
